  b. prepare contributions to the LibreHR project;
  c. evaluate the Software outside Production for up to 30 days per
     organisation.

4. Production use

Production use of the Software requires a valid Order. Your rights are
limited to the features, number of employees or other limits, and term
stated in the Order or in the licence key.
When an Order expires or ends, your right to use the Software in
Production ends with it. The Business features stop working. The
Community edition and all your data remain available to you, and the
Licensor will never block access to them.

5. Contractors and service providers

Your employees, and contractors or hosting providers acting on your behalf,
may exercise your rights under this licence for your benefit only. You are
responsible for their compliance with it.

6. Restrictions

Unless an Order says otherwise, you may not:
  a. remove, disable or circumvent the licence key check;
  b. change the key verification so that it accepts keys not issued by the
